# 5. User Authentication & Workspace

Businesses must create an account to use the platform.

### Features

User registration
Email verification
Login / logout
Password reset

Each user account operates within a **workspace** where campaigns and contacts are managed.

---

# 6. Contact Management

Businesses must manage their customer contact lists.

### Features

Add contacts manually
Upload contacts via CSV file
Import contacts through API

---

### Contact Fields

Name
Phone number
Telegram username (optional)
Tags
Custom attributes

---

### Contact Segmentation

Users can create segments based on:

Tags
Customer type
Location

Example segments:

VIP customers
New customers
Returning customers

---

# 7. Campaign Management

Businesses can create and manage messaging campaigns.

### Campaign Types

WhatsApp Campaign
Telegram Campaign
Multi-Channel Campaign (WhatsApp + Telegram)

---

### Campaign Creation Flow

1. Create campaign
2. Select contact list
3. Write message content
4. Select messaging platform
5. Send immediately or schedule

---

# 8. Messaging Platforms

The platform integrates with two messaging channels.

---

# 8.1 WhatsApp Messaging

WhatsApp campaigns are sent using **WhatsApp Business API providers**.

Supported message types:

Text messages
Images
Documents
Interactive buttons (optional)

---

### WhatsApp Campaign Features

Bulk messaging
Template messages
Scheduled campaigns
Delivery tracking

---

# 8.2 Telegram Messaging

Telegram campaigns are sent using **Telegram Bot API**.

Supported message types:

Text messages
Images
Documents
Links

---

### Telegram Campaign Features

Bulk messaging
Scheduled campaigns
Bot-based messaging

---

# 9. Multi-Channel Campaigns

Users can choose messaging platforms for campaigns.

### Campaign Platform Options

WhatsApp only
Telegram only
Both WhatsApp and Telegram

---

### Example Campaign Flow

Create campaign
↓
Select contact list
↓
Choose messaging platform

Options:

WhatsApp
Telegram
Both

↓
