Example:

Send promotion tomorrow at 10 AM.

---

# 12. Two-Way Messaging System

Customers can reply to messages sent through campaigns.

Incoming messages from WhatsApp and Telegram are captured using **webhooks from messaging providers**.

---

# 13. Conversation Management

Each customer has a conversation thread.

The system stores:

Incoming customer messages
Outgoing business replies

Conversation history allows businesses to maintain ongoing communication with customers.

---

# 14. Unified Chat Inbox

Businesses manage all customer conversations through a central inbox.

### Inbox Features

View conversations
Reply to messages
Search conversations
Filter chats

