# Final Summary

The **CampaignFlow SaaS Platform** enables businesses to run marketing campaigns through **WhatsApp and Telegram** while also enabling **two-way customer conversations**.

Key capabilities include:

Bulk messaging campaigns
Multi-channel messaging
Customer contact management
Two-way messaging support
Unified chat inbox
Campaign analytics

Businesses can send campaigns through:

WhatsApp
Telegram
Both simultaneously

